# <leader>aa: every Claude tab by state, with what each is doing.
Output docs/gifs/overview.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "UbuntuMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1280
Set Height 760
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Set Theme "OneDark"

Hide
Type "docs/demo/run-nvim.sh seed-groups.lua server.js" Enter
Sleep 5s
Show

Sleep 1.5s
Type " aa"
Sleep 2.5s
Down
Sleep 1.8s
Down
Sleep 1.8s
Up
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
